<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>If any section, clause, phrase, sentence or part of this Chapter is, for any reason, adjudged unconstitutional, invalid or unenforceable, only that part, clause, phrase, or section so declared will be void and the remainder will remain in full force and effect.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
