<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>This Chapter will be in full force and effect upon approval by the voters in the November 8, 2016, election. The tax levied in Section 6.07.030 will be imposed beginning on and after January 1, 2017. The Director is authorized to collect amounts receivable under this Chapter for taxes, interest and penalties.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
